inating entire classes of vulnerabilities that traditional testing methods may miss."},{question:"How can I get a security audit from CertiK?",answer:"You can request a security audit by visiting certik.com and submitting a quote request. CertiK's team will review your project requirements and provide a tailored proposal covering scope, timeline, and pricing for the appropriate security services."}]},uses:{params:["lng"]}}],
